  "content": "<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1f83bc51751dc611a40323ba357aabbb821ccf9c.png\" alt=\"frame1\" /> </p>\n\n**<center><font size=\"4\">進食動畫模組，但現在變成一個材質包了！</center>**\n\n<center> <a href='https://modrinth.com/mod/eating-animation'>--> 進食動畫模組 <--</a> </center>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/45e2627dbc9ecdcf4c9536d0f2c13ace0295dad7.png\" alt=\"frame2\" /> </p>\n\n<center>一個為可食用和可飲用物品添加動畫的材質包。\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OhzX8kDf/images/dcfae4a8fcaba12d522af8314b709d084c45a891.gif\" alt=\"drawing\" width=\"300\"/>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/963c8ee786e7020bc82536c65883acbb54686efe.png\" alt=\"frame3\" /> </p>\n\n只要下載並選取這個資源包，現在你不需要模組就能有動畫食物了！:)\n![Guide](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OhzX8kDf/images/dbc8c982ab0f6b1bc69a4f4dcb73ecf9be5b95ce.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7adbddf1ea62610623c4fb85115ecbc03133351f.png\" alt=\"frame4\" /> </p>",
